# =============================================================================
# Pipeline artefacts (analysis/01 -> analysis/07)
# =============================================================================
# The aggregated stage results are small, human-readable and worth versioning:
# they are the reproducible record of every number quoted in the README.
#
# Patient-level artefacts are NOT versioned. They carry `patient_id` for one
# row per patient, and this repository does not distribute patient-level
# RADCURE data (the raw workbook is not distributed either).
artifacts/04_oof_scores.csv
artifacts/06_heldout_predictions.csv


